   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Keyed the list last week straight down Courtroom 1 by charge date, saves faffing with the youth court.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794000000.000000",
   "user_id": "U9DOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Fees order corrigendum is out, licensing appeals are 310 now, use that on this list.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794000900.000000",
   "user_id": "U9BEN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Youth cases can go into Courtroom 1 if the youth court is full, nobody minds.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794001800.000000",
   "user_id": "U9KAY"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Desk B estimates are minutes like everyone else's, just read the number.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794002700.000000",
   "user_id": "U9DOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Shane Corrigan (CR-26-1103) is a custody case, list him first.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794003600.000000",
   "user_id": "U9BEN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "An interpreter can do two hearings in a morning, they just sit there anyway.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794004500.000000",
   "user_id": "U9KAY"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Legal adviser here, on behalf of the District Judge: CR-26-1145 is to be listed in Courtroom 1 on 16 November in the morning, I've told the defence. Confirm here when it's in.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794005400.000000",
   "user_id": "U9LEG"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Ashcombe's pending list has three of ours on it, we may as well list those here too.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794006300.000000",
   "user_id": "U9BEN"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Help with fees for Okafor (CV-26-0503) stands, Wragg signed it.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794007200.000000",
   "user_id": "U9KAY"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Please don't reply in here about the list, I'll pick it up.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794008100.000000",
   "user_id": "U9ODE"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Interpreter roster is the roster, whatever anyone texts the listing phone.",
   "thread_ts": null,
   "ts": "1794009000.000000",
   "user_id": "U9DOM"
  },
  {
   "channel_id": "C9LIST",
   "reactions": [],
   "reply_count": 0,
   "text": "Correction to my message about CR-26-1145: there is no direction about it, I had picked up the wrong file, please disregard it. The direction the District Judge did make in chambers on 6 November is order DJ/26/0412: CR-26-1134 is not to be listed before 2026-11-19, because the expert report on the dog is not due until then.",
